2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-01-20T18:46:55Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T15:10:37Z","closed_at":"2026-01-27T15:09:30Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n### Godot version\nv4.6.rc2.official [commit_hash]\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 , Vulkan Forward+\n\n### Issue description\n\n### Issue description\nThis is a **regression** from 4.6 RC1.\n\nIn 4.6 RC1, my project loaded fine with no errors.\nAfter updating to 4.6 RC2, opening the same project causes the Output to spam the following error repeatedly:\n\n> ERROR: Condition \"p_animation_library.is_null()\" is true. Returning: StringName()\n> at: get_animation_library_name (scene/animation/animation_mixer.cpp:286)\n\nThis seems similar to issue #113349, but I want to emphasize that **this was not happening in RC1**.\n\nIn 4.6 RC1, when opening the \"Manage Animations\" window, the library list was expanded by default and worked without issues. In 4.6 RC2, the \"Manage Animations\" window opens with the library list collapsed by default. Simply opening this window immediately triggers the p_animation_library.is_null() error 3 times.\n\nI suspect the collapsed UI state is causing the AnimationMixer to fail to retrieve the library name correctly during initialization.\n\n\n<img width=\"898\" height=\"136\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f4692d3-6d0b-4a57-8fa5-a5b0b7cb0e8d\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen a project in Godot 4.6 RC2 (I am using the Chinese localization, but it should apply generally).\n\nSelect an AnimationPlayer node.\n\nClick the \"Animation\" (动画) menu button in the bottom panel.\n\nSelect \"Manage Animations...\" (管理动画).\n\nThe \"Edit Animation Libraries\" (编辑动画库) window pops up.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNo MRP needed. Reproducible in any new project by opening the \"Manage Animations\" window.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115185/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115185/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}